    "The retrospective outbuilding, by virtue of the inadequate floorspace and layout associated with its use as habitable space results in a sub-standard form of accommodation that detracts from the established development pattern within the setting and one that would not be able to cater for the reasonable needs of future occupiers, contrary to Policies D3 and D6 of the London Plan (2021), Policies CP4 and CP30 of the Enfield Core Strategy 2010, Policy DMD8 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014), the Nationally Described Space Standard (2015) as well as the NPPF (2024)."
